47_4318760208821788483_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7pc7MMAjS4UQ7kNvwG2pTTq&_nc_oc=AdrgSPe1tARiAvjUdQbKQQ86NZ1u_8v_7Mj4w6YVPdrC40Zv2caZY0EZRSFZ7OfhmWo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_i0r7ad8W9P83ln23YB_RC9SD3H3-XcpQTW0jFnJa0ng&oe=6A219996"}, {"file_name": "PLIV_meta_01.png", "id": "1617813526316404", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618910_1617813529649737_5188882722312151208_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NEC3YgMjLxkQ7kNvwEwMwpc&_nc_oc=AdoDIkRayaSiOZEosjFzeZO64xer3ZOmE_2YFnuzu8qeYWOZK0isfOFcSk1f11yvlD4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9TKHjJvd2KITN9aBgU--zr29nnSQHD5wr-aWc5sd7sVw&oe=6A2193D0"}, {"file_name": "Plans 2D.png", "id": "1912780915990828", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618512_1912780919324161_4210466507695396984_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IgklbQPGlaYQ7kNvwGvtf1g&_nc_oc=AdrKUcw6Pu4-p6RjIAEBtyHyANxqVIWZIsRXB_Bov64XZPSWQrBtn_uZHsC3jyrHbbQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-2vuaGq7A2yBagAzjan8yheH-FZEzP8x0jjYnRyuKAHw&oe=6A21920F"}, {"file_name": "PLIV_meta_02.png", "id": "1426797192165089", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622919_1426797195498422_2473317681714849547_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gfJYd7H1qeQQ7kNvwHxKO3P&_nc_oc=AdoMamRTF327f8zp3oawUzEuSXZyx2h8oT0ptUL84a3CSO3_99hX39PulZl3ppm3gBY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_fL9WA4zpaLAOcU7M2P0TnTTbtCrb9SRMAw0KPT5MkTA&oe=6A2174A9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Projected Living", "keywords": ["House", "Home", "Tours", "Architecture", "Archviz"], "long_description": "A new way to experience a home before it exists. Projected Living allows you to explore homes and real estate developments before they are built at a real 1:1 scale, using advanced 3D visualization, Augmented Reality (AR), and Virtual Reality (VR) technology.\n\nOur platform transforms the way off-plan real estate projects are presented and marketed. By combining immersive experiences with powerful sales tools, Projected Living helps buyers truly understand the spaces, increasing confidence, interest, and speed in the decision-making process.\n\nThe experience can be enjoyed from different devices, always offering a fluid, intuitive and high-quality display for both business teams and end customers.\n\nMain features:\n\u2022 1:1 scale visualization \u2013 experience the spaces as they will be built\n\u2022 Free movement \u2013 \u200b\u200bexplore the property without fixed points, as if you were in a video game\n\u2022 Augmented Reality tours \u2013 explore the spaces by walking through AR\n\u2022 Centralized marketing content repository \u2013 renders, floor plans, 360\u00b0 views, infographics, and project information\n\u2022 Real-world context \u2013 image integration to visualize real views of the development\n\u2022 Comparison of layouts and finishes \u2013 instantly switch between floor plans and materials\n\u2022 Interactive exteriors \u2013 visualize the development within its urban environment\n\u2022 Advanced sales tools \u2013 guided tours, inventory control, metrics, and analytics\n\u2022 Remote sales \u2013 conduct immersive guided tours with clients from anywhere in the world", "short_description": "Explore real-scale 1:1 floor plans of homes using 3D, AR and VR technology."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.projectedliving.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.projectedliving.com/terms", "publisher_name": "Picus Digital SL", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.projectedliving.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "106